xplr for Debian
---------------

This package ships no configuration file. xplr has its defaults compiled in, so
there is nothing in /etc for dpkg to track and nothing to merge on upgrade.

To customise it, copy the shipped example and edit your copy:

  /usr/share/doc/xplr/examples/init.lua

to ~/.config/xplr/init.lua.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>
